description "Naboo Guard

Quick, versatile guards. Adept at disabling enemies.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shock Baton (Yellow/Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers on hit
-- 10% more knockback
-- 50% shorter
-- 33% thicker
- Naboo S-5 Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 10% faster RoF
-- 15% less damage
-- 10% less FP damage
- CR-2 Heavy Blaster Pistol (1)
- 1 Sonic Detonator

^8Attributes:
- 2 Reinforcements
- Security Strength (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[Melee CS4]

Naboo Guards policed the city of Theed before it was taken over by the Trade Federation, and now act as an underground resistance group."